## Output Format

Return ONLY valid JSON matching the required schema.
- Do not include any text before or after the JSON
- Do not rename or add fields
- Produce exactly 12 entries in `items`, in OPTION-12 order (item 1 first, item 12 last)
- `evidence` must be verbatim quote(s) carried over from the per-chunk
  evaluations above (which are themselves verbatim from the transcript), or
  the literal string `"No relevant utterance"` when no chunk observed the
  behavior
- Keep `justification` concise (one or two sentences) and explain why the
  selected evidence warrants the final score under the item's anchors
